{"id": 63, "name": "Selena", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/a/a4/Hero631-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142149", "cls": ["Assassin", "Mage"], "specialty": ["Initiator", "Finisher"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["30", "70", "100", "70"], "lanes": ["", ""], "story": "Dark Elf girl who fell into the Abyss.", "skills": [{"name": "Symbiosis", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_32860acd4d3f0f6e34c80e70db4f3963.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Selena can switch freely between her two forms.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Elven Form</span>: Selena applies <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Mark</span> when her skills deal damage. Marks last 8s and can stack up to 2 times.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Form</span>: Selena's Basic Attacks become melee and deal <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+25% Total Magic Power)</span> additional <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. Her skills deal 240-450<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+40% Total Magic Power)</span> additional <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Mark</span> and consume their mark stacks by 1. This damage is increased to 250% against Creeps and Minions."}, {"name": "Abyssal Trap", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_62637c2435b75abec80321bb1544fc30.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Selena summons an Abyssal Devil to lurk underground. The Abyssal Devil will attach itself to any enemy that approaches, inflicting a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Mark</span> and reducing their Movement Speed by 50% for 1s. The Abyssal Devil then explodes, dealing 350<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in the area and reducing their Movement Speed by 50% for 1s.\n\nEach additional Abyssal Devil on an enemy increases the final damage by 50%.\n\nEach Abyssal Devil can lurk up to 60s and up to 3 Abyssal Devils can exist at the same time."}, {"name": "Abyssal Arrow", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e672c608df7806e99148d0176149a316.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 80", "desc": "Selena fires an abyssal wraith in the target direction that stops when it hits an enemy hero, Creep, or Summon, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+20% Total Magic Power)</span> to 500<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+40% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the target hit and stunning them for 0.5s to 2.5s while revealing their locations (the damage and stun duration increase with the wraith's travel distance).\n\nThe wraith will pick up <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Trap</span> as it travels over it and will apply the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">trap</span> to the enemy target upon stunning them.\n\nIf the wraith stuns an enemy for 0.9s or longer, Selena will gain 60% Movement Speed for 2s."}, {"name": "Primal Darkness", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_abd29236983e4d3d1bfd361b2e242111.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5.5", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Selena gains 5 Magic Power.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Selena enters Abyssal Form, gaining 20% Movement Speed for 0.8s and immediately resetting the cooldowns of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Eater</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Garotte</span>."}, {"name": "Symbiosis", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_32860acd4d3f0f6e34c80e70db4f3963.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Selena can switch freely between her two forms.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Elven Form</span>: Selena applies <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Mark</span> when her skills deal damage. Marks last 8s and can stack up to 2 times.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Form</span>: Selena's Basic Attacks become melee and deal <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+25% Total Magic Power)</span> additional <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. Her skills deal 240-450<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+40% Total Magic Power)</span> additional <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Mark</span> and consume their mark stacks by 1. This damage is increased to 250% against Creeps and Minions."}, {"name": "Soul Eater", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_beba48ddc774a4267f72ba8a93666998.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6", "desc": "Selena strengthens her claws with the power of the Abyss, causing the next Basic Attack to dash to a target and deal an additional 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+130% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> while granting her a 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> shield.\n\nIf this damage detonates an <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Mark</span>, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Garotte's</span> cooldown will reset."}, {"name": "Garotte", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c2a0d728e05af9460c1cfa97bd0acd56.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Selena charges in the target direction, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in her path.\n\nIf this skill's damage detonates an <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Mark</span>, its cooldown will reset."}, {"name": "Blessing of the Moon Goddess", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3dbdc17e11dddcec7a3547f79de6f42c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5.5", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Gains 5 Magic Power.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Selena enters Elven Form, gaining 20% Movement Speed for 0.8s and immediately resetting the cooldowns of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Trap</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Arrow</span>."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Genius Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5f615aa7cb949d4e43d24561b12ff0e1.png"}, {"name": "Berserker's Fury", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_020f531307fa505083b791e6f3093eb4.png"}, {"name": "Holy Crystal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_25c17fb08406548b8476673ce7fc3078.png"}, {"name": "Divine Glaive", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ef0ab8d629f06ebd67cf2b65e144f803.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Mage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb